        <mxCell id="2O3HAQBy4T7X0kwtkqwP-17" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Spectral Species Identity and Ecological Consistency Across Plots&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;--&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;To determine if spectral species classifications align with observed habitat types and plant communities, Chi-squared and Fisher&#39;s exact tests were utilized.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
